OL,3,GNEWSAI was in so much pain I could
OL,4,Abarely feed my cats - now I'm back as a
OL,5,Apro wrestler
OL,6,
OL,7,FProfessional wrestling storylines are
OL,8,Foften built around surprise moments,
OL,9,Ffrom unexpected returns to sudden plot
OL,10,Ftwists.
OL,12,FHowever when British star Jamie Hayter
OL,13,Fsuffered two herniated discs in her
OL,14,Fback in 2023, she feared she would
OL,15,Fnever get back in the ring.
OL,17,FIt left her in constant pain, barely
OL,18,Fable to feed her cats - and wondering
OL,19,Fif her career was over.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
